Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:05.72,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\pos(640,340.296)\fade(255,0,255,0,700,4720,5320)}Episode 27
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.40,0:00:05.72,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,700,4720,5320)\pos(640,545.096)}Three Visits to the Thatched Cottage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.70,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,General, aren't you Overseer Liu of Yu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.70,0:00:40.20,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Are you seeking my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.04,0:00:39.52,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2200,2480)\pos(1012.332,159.174)}Zhūgě Jūn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:46.80,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,This way, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.91,0:00:55.11,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Please, take a seat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.59,0:01:04.37,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.68,0:01:05.36,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.36,0:01:06.07,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.54,0:01:11.76,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, you are...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.92,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,I am Sleeping Dragon's younger brother, Zhuge Jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:17.02,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,We are three brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:18.62,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,The eldest is Zhuge Jin.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.62,0:01:21.23,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,He is an apparitor of Sun Zhongmou in Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.23,0:01:23.44,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Kongming is our middle brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.16,0:01:30.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,5500,5080)\pos(278.121,489.485)}Liú Bèi \NStyled: Xuándé
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.38,0:01:31.60,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,So, is the Sleeping Dragon at home today?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.42,0:01:34.10,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,You've arrived too late, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.10,0:01:36.66,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,My brother met up with Cui Zhouping yesterday,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.66,0:01:38.49,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,going outside to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.26,0:01:43.86,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,And where did he go?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.42,0:01:49.34,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Perhaps they went sailing on rivers on a small boat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.34,0:01:52.30,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Perhaps they went to visit Daoists in mountains.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.30,0:01:54.84,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Perhaps they went to a friend's village.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.84,0:01:57.46,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Perhaps they went to play the zither or Go in a cave.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.46,0:02:00.68,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,His travels are unpredictable; I know not where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.33,0:02:08.15,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Perhaps my destiny is this pathetic.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.89,0:02:11.66,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Twice, I failed to meet such a wise paragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.66,0:02:13.60,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How regrettable!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.27,0:02:16.58,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Please, sit for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.19,0:02:18.81,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Page, some tea please?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.65,0:02:27.78,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Brother, the snow's falling fast! We better leave soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.18,0:02:32.58,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Since my brother isn't here,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.58,0:02:34.26,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,I dare not keep you any longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.95,0:02:40.06,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir, I will visit again in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.81,0:02:42.75,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,May I borrow a brush and ink?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.75,0:02:46.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I wish to leave a heartfelt letter to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.24,0:02:49.62,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Page, bring a brush and inkstone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.62,0:02:50.26,Default,Page,0,0,0,,Coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.70,0:03:06.06,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I deeply admire your exalted genius, Sleeping Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.06,0:03:08.90,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Twice I came to pay my respects and missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.90,0:03:10.92,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}It is most regrettable.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.20,0:03:14.48,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I, Liu Bei, am a scion of the Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.48,0:03:16.22,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Witnessing the empire crumbling,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.22,0:03:17.60,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}warlords causing chaos,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.60,0:03:19.78,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and ill cliques abusing the Emperor,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.78,0:03:22.42,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}my insides are torn asunder with grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.42,0:03:25.24,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Though I have the ambition to uphold the Han dynasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.24,0:03:27.76,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I am sorely lacking in governance and strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.36,0:03:32.46,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My only hope is your benevolence and righteousness.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.20,0:03:38.00,Note (Potential style?),Liu Bei,0,0,0,,TL: "Noble aspirations form from content and unassuming character;\Nfar destinations are reached by tranquility and quietude."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.46,0:03:37.06,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Were you to muster the talents \Nof Lü Wang and the plans of Zifang,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.06,0:03:41.57,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}then the Empire and its spirits would be fortunate indeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.60,0:03:44.38,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Allow me to express myself:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.38,0:03:47.16,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}For my next visit, I will purify myself by fasting.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.16,0:03:51.00,Thinking,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I will offer my respects and receive your teachings.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.16,0:03:56.79,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Give this to your brother. I shall take my leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.82,0:04:08.34,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,Have a safe return, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.34,0:04:11.80,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The freezing northern wind at night!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.80,0:04:13.27,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,The old master has arrived.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.60,0:04:22.50,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Red clouds thousands of {\i1}li{\i0} long!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.50,0:04:30.03,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Snow in the vast sky flutters awry!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.03,0:04:38.20,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The old mountains have changed!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.20,0:04:46.08,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I face upward and gaze upon creation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.08,0:04:54.14,Thinking,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Is it a fight between jade dragons?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.14,0:05:00.80,Thinking,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Scales fly one after another!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.80,0:05:07.03,Thinking,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They are suddenly all over creation!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.86,0:05:14.82,Thinking,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The mule crosses a small bridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.82,0:05:22.86,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}My only regret is how scant the plums are!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.99,0:05:18.27,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Who is that gentleman?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.04,0:05:21.92,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,My brother's father-in-law, Huang Chengyan.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.44,0:05:35.21,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,Sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.21,0:05:39.32,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Master Huang, the lines you sung are most inspiring!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.16,0:05:46.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3840,4160)\pos(327.376,401.774)}Huáng Chéngyàn
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:48.50,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,I learned the {\i1}Litany of Liangfu{\i0}\N at my son-in-law's house.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.96,0:05:48.50,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,The {\i1}Litany of Liangfu{\i0} [梁父吟] was a folk song from Shandong. Historically, Zhuge Liang had a particular liking for this ballad.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.71,0:05:51.78,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,When I was crossing the bridge,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.78,0:05:54.90,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,I happened to spot a few plums by a fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.90,0:05:57.60,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,Overcome by emotion, I started to sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.60,0:06:01.08,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,I didn't know I was overheard by an august figure!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.90,0:06:07.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Dear sir, have you seen your son-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.16,0:06:07.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4000,4420)\pos(296.487,459.529)}Guān Yǔ\NStyled: Yúncháng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.24,0:06:10.30,Default,Huang Chengyan,0,0,0,,I also came to visit him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.94,Default,Diviner,0,0,0,,Noble sir,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.31,0:07:53.94,Default,Diviner,0,0,0,,four days from now is a most auspicious day.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.44,0:07:56.54,Default,Diviner,0,0,0,,You should part then.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.22,0:07:58.97,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.43,0:08:01.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Excellent!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:06.38,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Part of etiquette and ritual since the Zhou dynasty, an utmost \Nshow of respect and reverence to someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.10,0:08:04.78,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Starting now, I will fast for three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.78,0:08:06.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I will fast for three days!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.38,0:08:08.42,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Only then may I go visit Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.06,0:08:15.00,Default,Diviner,0,0,0,,No need to accompany me further!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.29,0:08:17.02,Default,Diviner,0,0,0,,No need.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.02,0:08:17.76,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Safe travels.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.68,0:08:31.22,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, I held back the other two times.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.31,0:08:35.48,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Now I must speak my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.88,0:08:41.81,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Twice, you visited Wolong Hillock for Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.90,0:08:43.79,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,You're sacrificing so much for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.92,0:08:48.54,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Maybe his fame's fake and he's just a fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.45,0:08:51.88,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,That's why he's too scared to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.16,0:08:58.44,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Brother, you're familiar with {\i1}the Spring and Autumn Annals.{\i0} You should know!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.44,0:09:03.28,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,When Duke of Huan of Qi sought the Commoner East of the Walls, he had to visit five times to meet him!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.66,0:09:06.78,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: The commoner who lived east of the walls was Xiaochen Qi [小臣稷].\NDuke Huán of Qí was the first of the Five Hegemons in the Spring and Autumn period.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.28,0:09:07.16,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Besides, who I am seeking is a great prodigy of our age!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.06,0:09:09.78,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,You don't need to go there yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.78,0:09:11.72,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I will bring him here myself!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.72,0:09:12.46,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Men!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.46,0:09:12.89,Default,Soldiers,0,0,0,,Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:14.58,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Bring my horse and some rope!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.86,0:09:16.34,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'm going to Wolong Hillock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.36,0:09:16.92,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.78,0:09:18.58,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.58,0:09:19.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.81,0:09:20.63,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.25,0:09:21.85,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.66,0:09:28.48,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother, what are you trying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:30.94,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,1690,2080)\pos(959.509,492.552)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.84,0:09:31.76,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Summoning Sleeping Dragon on your behalf!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.40,0:09:33.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,And how?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.81,0:09:36.22,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,If he doesn't come,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.22,0:09:38.39,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'll use this rope to bring him here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.04,0:09:39.43,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.02,0:09:41.94,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.39,0:09:46.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Are you trying to jeopardize my entire future?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.75,0:09:53.56,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Because Cao Cao has so many wise strategists,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.56,0:09:55.47,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he was able to rout Yuan Shao!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.66,0:10:00.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sun Quan commands the entire swath of Jiangdong!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.14,0:10:02.70,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is due to the talents he has acquired.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.70,0:10:04.49,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}They will surely become hegemons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.68,0:10:10.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}But I still depend on Liu Biao, \Ncondemned to puny place like Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.36,0:10:17.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}All this because I lack a sage by my side who can administer stratagems and cultivate armies!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.14,0:10:20.02,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}We are sworn brothers, sharing life and death!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.02,0:10:24.08,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}So how can you still be blind to my goal?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.49,0:10:27.35,Default,Guan Yu & Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.35,0:10:29.09,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.09,0:10:30.14,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Third Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.64,0:10:36.32,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Have you not heard... \NHow King Wen of Zhou visited Jiang Ziya?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.86,0:10:36.32,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Jiang Ziya fished for survival and lived in poverty.\N King Wen made him his chief strategist despite this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.37,0:10:39.98,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Even King Wen desired to be most respectful!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.98,0:10:42.00,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Why do you act with insolence?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.70,0:10:44.46,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}You must stay behind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.46,0:10:45.88,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I shall go with Yunchang!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.36,0:10:47.47,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.96,0:10:51.58,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,But you two are my beloved older brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.58,0:10:54.64,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,How could you leave your younger brother behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.36,0:11:00.19,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.92,0:11:04.38,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You may come with us,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.38,0:11:06.68,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,but please do not show any disrespect!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:10.76,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I understand, Elder Brother, I understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.98,0:12:06.84,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Mister Zhuge Jun, is your noble brother home?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.16,0:12:08.90,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,He arrived at dusk yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.90,0:12:12.38,Default,Zhuge Jun,0,0,0,,You may meet with him today, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.21,0:12:15.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Many thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.88,0:12:26.59,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,The sheer insolence!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:29.34,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,What's stopping him from escorting us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.98,0:12:32.00,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,He just waved his hands and left!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.12,0:12:35.78,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Everyone is busy in some way, we cannot force them.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.78,0:12:36.88,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Remember my warning.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.18,0:12:38.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Mind your manners.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.96,0:12:41.86,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Understood, Elder Brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.61,0:13:50.66,Default,Page,0,0,0,,So you visit again, General Liu?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.78,0:13:55.32,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Might you pass the news that I wish to pay respects?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.66,0:13:58.88,Default,Page,0,0,0,,The master is at home, but he's sleeping in the cottage.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.37,0:14:01.56,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Well then, do not disturb him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.46,0:14:08.64,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Brothers, wait outside for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.14,0:14:11.86,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,The master is sleeping, we should not disturb him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.90,0:14:26.80,Default,Page,0,0,0,,General, after...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.14,0:14:43.22,Default,Page,0,0,0,,Why don't you wait inside, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.60,0:14:46.91,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I will wait until your master is awake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.83,0:15:00.83,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.70,0:15:06.45,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,The hubris of this "master"!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.45,0:15:08.66,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Elder Brother's at his porch and he naps!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.66,0:15:09.37,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.15,0:15:11.98,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I'll burn his cottage down,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.98,0:15:13.50,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,see if he still naps then!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.50,0:15:14.33,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.00,0:15:15.73,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.44,0:15:16.97,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.91,0:15:22.08,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother, you boor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:23.29,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.86,0:15:24.65,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Third Brother...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.80,0:16:34.36,Default,Page,0,0,0,,I will go wake the master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.85,0:16:37.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Do not disturb him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.26,0:16:38.33,Default,Page,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.58,0:17:19.58,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Who shall be the first to escape heavy dreams?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.11,0:17:22.84,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I have understood myself for all my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.35,0:17:27.98,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}The thatched cottage in the spring provides rest;
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.98,0:17:32.94,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}the sun outside the window persists.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.10,0:17:37.03,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Were there any visitors?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:40.26,Default,Page,0,0,0,,Imperial Uncle Liu's been waiting the whole day.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.26,0:17:42.14,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,And you are telling me this only now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.14,0:17:44.10,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Let me change my clothes and meet him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:10.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(963.332,473.085)}Zhūgě Liàng \NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.90,0:18:27.42,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I am a lowly imperial scion of Zhuo Commandery.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.42,0:18:29.82,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,For so long have I heard of your thunderous fame.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.82,0:18:32.40,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Twice I came and missed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.90,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I left behind a letter,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.90,0:18:35.80,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,were you able to read it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.25,0:18:39.62,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I am but an unsophisticated man of Nanyang.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.62,0:18:42.48,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,For you to bless me with your presence is too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.48,0:18:44.24,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,After you, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.74,0:18:45.62,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Thank you, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.55,0:18:48.79,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Wait here, brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.90,0:19:01.56,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I have already perused your letter, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.56,0:19:04.38,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I perceived your worries for the state and the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.46,0:19:07.90,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I regret to say that I have but meager talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.90,0:19:10.07,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,You are asking advice from a lesser lad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.21,0:19:14.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,But Sir Water Mirror and Xu Yuanzhi praised you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.90,0:19:17.05,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How could their praise be without merit?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.05,0:19:19.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I hope you do not abandon me, unworthy I may be,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.54,0:19:21.72,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,and please lend me your erudite guidance.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.32,0:19:25.13,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Decao and Yuanzhi are exalted scholars of our age.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.13,0:19:28.44,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I am but a farmer, how could I discuss politics?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.44,0:19:33.59,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Would you throw away fine jade for rough stones?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.59,0:19:35.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sir, you are too modest.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.54,0:19:38.46,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Great men wish to employ the talents of this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.46,0:19:41.28,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}How could I waste my days hiding in the mountains?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.28,0:19:46.74,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Please think of the commoners in this world and accept this dull pupil.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.76,0:20:00.50,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}In that case, \NI shall hear you, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.58,0:20:16.86,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}The House of Han is collapsing, \Nwhile treacherous consuls seize authority.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.24,0:20:21.54,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}I do not know the extent of my virtue, \Nbut I wish to propagate justice all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.53,0:20:27.33,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12}However, lacking in wisdom and skills, I have accomplished nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.33,0:20:30.27,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If you may be gracious to aid me from this calamity...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.00,0:20:32.80,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}I would be most fortunate!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.66,0:20:45.34,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Since the treachery of Dong Zhuo, magnates and lords have risen to the forefront.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.54,0:20:49.91,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cáo Cāo's strength couldn't compare with that of Yuan Shao,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.91,0:20:53.16,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}yet Cao Cao was the man who defeated Yuan Shao.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.16,0:20:55.38,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Not only was this based on chance timing,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.38,0:20:57.67,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}but also the benefit from others' cunning.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.75,0:21:04.90,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Cao Cao now controls a host of one million, \Ncoercing the Son of Heaven to command the lords.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.90,0:21:07.32,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}He cannot be contended with.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:12.61,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Sun Quan is the third of his clan to rule Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.61,0:21:16.74,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With difficult terrain and prosperous people, he can be relied on for support,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.74,0:21:18.84,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and not to be conspired against.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.25,0:21:28.23,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Jing Province has the Rivers Han and Mian to its north,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.23,0:21:30.54,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}which give access to the Southern Sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.54,0:21:32.88,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With lands of Wu to its east and Shu to its west,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.88,0:21:37.08,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}it is a location for military force, \Nyet its lord is incapable of defense.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.08,0:21:39.87,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is a land granted you by Heaven, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.75,0:21:45.56,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Might you be interested in it, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.90,0:21:51.59,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yi Province is west of Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.59,0:21:55.70,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}With treacherous roads but fertile earth, \N'tis a land of the plenty sent by Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.70,0:21:58.42,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}With it did Gaozu accomplish his imperial designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.42,0:22:00.34,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Yet Liu Zhang is dim-witted and weak.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.34,0:22:03.78,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Though his land is rich, he does not know how to support his people and army.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.78,0:22:07.60,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Therefore, its talents yearn for an enlightened ruler.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.69,0:22:12.01,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}General, you are a scion of the imperial clan!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.01,0:22:16.25,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Your noble intent is famed, for you thirst for wise sages like water!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.25,0:22:18.62,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}If you can control Jing and Yi provinces,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.62,0:22:20.45,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}fortify its rugged terrain,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.45,0:22:22.80,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}appease the tribes of the western Rong and southern Yue,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.80,0:22:26.32,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}ally with Eastern Wu, and strengthen stability.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.32,0:22:27.90,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}When the moment is right,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.90,0:22:31.25,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}bid a general to lead the Jing army to rivers Yuan and Luo;
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:35.37,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}you would lead the army of Yi Province to the Qinchuan region!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.25,0:22:35.37,Note (Potential style?),Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Note: The Qinchuan region (秦川) generally refers to Chang'an and the surrounding lands.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.37,0:22:39.04,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Then, how could the people not welcome you with food and drink, General?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.82,0:22:41.78,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Do exactly this,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.78,0:22:45.52,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}and you may achieve your great undertaking \Nand revive the Han dynasty!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.00,0:22:53.88,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}In your quest for hegemony,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.88,0:22:56.06,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Cao Cao will have his Heaven-sent chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.06,0:22:57.83,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and Sun Quan the benefits of Earth,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.83,0:23:01.08,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}while you, General, will have the support and unity of the people.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.68,0:23:08.28,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}This is a map of the fifty-four counties of the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.19,0:23:11.42,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}First, take Jing Province as your home,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.42,0:23:13.34,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}then seize Yi Province as your base.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:15.22,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}All form the legs of a cauldron,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.34,0:23:17.28,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: Referring to Ding (鼎), a ritual vessel with three legs, and also a symbol of power. A metaphor for three separate states.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.22,0:23:17.56,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}and then, aim for the Central Plains.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:25.84,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,{\bord12}This is the grand strategy I present for your great undertaking, General.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.40,0:23:30.91,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,In just a few words, you have opened my eyes, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.91,0:23:34.24,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,With you, I can see the blue sky through dark clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.03,0:23:37.98,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,However...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.39,0:23:46.97,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Liu Biao of Jing and Liu Zhang of Yi are of the imperial family.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.97,0:23:50.04,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,How could I bring myself to steal from them?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:51.15,0:23:53.18,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,By my observation of Heaven's signs,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.18,0:23:55.94,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Liu Biao shall not be in this world for long.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.94,0:23:57.86,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Liu Zhang is not a man of ambition,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.86,0:24:00.76,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,and after some time, the west shall submit to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.98,0:24:06.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Without leaving this cottage, \Nyou already see the world split into three!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.34,0:24:10.90,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,No one throughout the ages can compare!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.90,0:24:13.66,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Although my fame and virtue are both meager,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.66,0:24:16.26,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I hope sir does not resent to offer me your help!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.26,0:24:20.10,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I will listen to your erudite advice!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.69,0:24:25.46,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I am content tilling land, \Nstressing not over the realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.46,0:24:26.86,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I cannot accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.90,0:24:37.42,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Sir...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.52,0:24:40.96,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Will you really stay here without helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.15,0:24:43.94,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I fear I cannot accept.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.78,0:24:56.12,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,If sir will not leave your retreat, \Nwhat is left anymore for the people?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.32,0:25:33.49,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,To realize the general's dream, \NI, Zhūgé Liàng, vow to serve you with utmost loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.18,0:26:05.25,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k80}Shù {\k60}fǎ {\k51}dú {\k45}shī {\k73}shū,{\k40} xiū {\k52}dé {\k84}jiān {\k143}xiū {\k36}shēn{\k120}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.28,0:26:12.49,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k58}Yǎng {\k66}guān {\k29}yǔ {\k53}fǔ{\k186}chá, {\k37}tāo{\k81}lüè {\k44}xiōng{\k51}zhōng {\k50}cún{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.60,0:26:20.56,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k57}Gōng{\k54}gēng {\k53}cóng {\k59}wèi {\k170}wàng {\k227}yōu {\k67}guó,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.64,0:26:28.64,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k71}shéi {\k64}zhī {\k64}rè{\k224}xuè {\k46}zài {\k66}shān{\k258}lín.{\k0}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.95,0:26:37.06,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k71}Fèng{\k134}xī, {\k47}fèng{\k153}xī! {\k117}Sī {\k107}gāo{\k62}jǔ
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.03,0:26:44.60,Song,,0,0,0,,{\k79}shì {\k21}luàn {\k61}shí {\k52}wēi {\k98}jiǔ {\k107}chén{\k209}yín{\k10}
