Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.42,0:26:00.06,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Reading books with hair in bind,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.06,0:26:05.19,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}raising virtue, morals and mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:05.19,0:26:09.30,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Observing high and gazing low,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.30,0:26:13.42,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}deep in thought, as schemes were stowed.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.42,0:26:20.52,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Tilling fields yet not forgetting, \N musing for the realm's well-being.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.52,0:26:29.81,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Who knew such hot-blood had been boiling, \N in the mountain woods within.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:29.81,0:26:34.02,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Phoenix, oh phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.02,0:26:37.96,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}High are your sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.96,0:26:46.22,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Grieving for the nation's plight.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.22,0:26:50.30,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Phoenix, oh phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.30,0:26:54.32,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}High are your sights!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.32,0:27:02.58,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Grieving for the nation's plight.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.58,0:27:05.62,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Visits three to cottage thatched,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:05.62,0:27:10.72,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}he offers consultations.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.72,0:27:14.82,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}After half a lifetime's passed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.82,0:27:19.02,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}heart stirs from hibernation.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.02,0:27:26.18,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Morning comes as sword was taken, leaving for a lord most worthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.18,0:27:34.90,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Feather fan and headscarf hempen, sooting on the great long journey.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:39.46,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Dragon, oh dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.46,0:27:43.50,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Wind and cloud now meet at last!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:43.50,0:27:51.72,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Crying for ambitions vast!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.72,0:27:55.86,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Going forth, going forth from to and fro,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.86,0:27:59.95,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}for that cherished dream I hold;
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.95,0:28:10.04,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To be again a farmer, in my years of old!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.04,0:28:14.34,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Clear wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.34,0:28:18.46,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}bright moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.46,0:28:34.84,Thinking,Singer 1,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}embracing me, as apes and cranes hear my zither.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.84,0:28:43.00,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12}Fickle are the ways of Heaven, as fates elude from inquiry.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.00,0:28:47.08,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Guile determines wins and losses,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.08,0:28:51.02,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}vows he with sincere loyalty.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.02,0:28:58.33,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To be alive, must true men do by right,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.33,0:29:07.41,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}to sow the seeds of peace for good of all humanity.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.41,0:29:11.70,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Going forth, going forth from to and fro,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.70,0:29:15.83,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}for that cherished dream I hold;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.83,0:29:24.04,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To be again a farmer, in my years of old!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.04,0:29:28.16,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Going forth, going forth from to and fro,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.16,0:29:32.18,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}for that cherished dream I hold;
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.18,0:29:41.74,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}To be again a farmer, in my years of old!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.32,0:29:46.54,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}Clear wind,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.54,0:29:50.62,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}bright moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.62,0:30:05.76,Thinking,Singer 2,0,0,0,,{\bord12\pos(640,660)}embracing me, as apes and cranes hear my zither.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.48,0:31:14.34,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Switch formations.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.34,0:31:14.60,Default,Soldier,0,0,0,,Yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.18,0:31:45.20,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Acquiring your services is like a fish getting water!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.21,0:31:51.96,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.96,0:31:53.53,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,You are hard at work, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.96,0:32:00.00,Note (Potential style?),Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Note: Zhuge Liang's initial rank was "Strategist-General of the Household" (军师中郎将); an idiosyncratic title invented by Liu Bei to bestow more military authority than a normal strategist.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.99,0:31:54.38,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.45,0:32:04.82,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,My lord, these fresh recruits still need training.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.82,0:32:06.44,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Only then can they fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.44,0:32:09.50,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Without drilling, a hundred men are weaker than one.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.50,0:32:12.10,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,With drilling, one man can equal a hundred.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.10,0:32:13.06,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Excellent.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.06,0:32:15.22,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Ever since you left your mountain home,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.22,0:32:18.69,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,you have toiled to establish tactics and train soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:20.38,0:32:23.60,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I weaved this hat as a token of my appreciation.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.18,0:32:29.16,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,My liege, do you have lofty ambitions?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.54,0:32:32.92,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Why spend your time weaving hats?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.38,0:32:35.00,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,How can you be so ungrateful?!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.00,0:32:37.88,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,I saw Elder Brother work hard on it day and night!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:37.88,0:32:41.32,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,He made you this hat personally \Nand this is how you thank him!?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.44,0:32:46.98,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I do appreciate your kindness, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.30,0:32:50.94,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Still, I left my abode to labor for your grand design.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.94,0:32:53.67,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Never have I forgotten your aspirations.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:54.50,0:32:57.10,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Our tenuous situation is like a pile of eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.10,0:32:59.10,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,This is my position.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.72,0:33:01.90,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,I know you appreciate it as well, my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.97,0:33:09.50,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,I understand your concerns, Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.22,0:33:14.89,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Cao Cao's generals also make me apprehensive.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.39,0:33:16.78,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Worry not, my liege.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.78,0:33:18.82,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,May we inspect Bowang Slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.77,0:33:25.03,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,Bowang Slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:27.26,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,If Cao Cao was invading,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.26,0:33:29.46,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,they'd come directly to Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.46,0:33:31.23,Default,Guan Yu,0,0,0,,What would he do at Bowang Slope?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.79,0:33:35.05,Default,Zhang Fei,0,0,0,,Clearly he wants to enjoy the nature!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.82,0:33:56.47,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,My lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.48,0:33:59.26,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Before us stands Bowang Slope.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.62,0:34:08.76,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,My lord, Bowang Slope has many trees and bushes.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.38,0:34:14.12,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,When the Cao troops arrive, lead them to the gorge.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.12,0:34:16.00,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,We will attack them with fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.09,0:34:20.61,Default,Zhuge Liang,0,0,0,,Let us keep surveying the terrain ahead, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.61,0:34:21.46,Default,Liu Bei,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.49,0:34:30.46,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After the death of Sun Ce,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.46,0:34:33.27,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Quan inherited his and their father's territory.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.27,0:34:37.50,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Guarding Jiangdong, he recruited many talented men.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.50,0:34:39.62,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Cao Cao, trying to control Jiangdong,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.62,0:34:43.02,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,asked Sun Quan to send his son to serve the court,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.02,0:34:44.90,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,intending to keep him as a hostage.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.92,0:34:45.24,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,420,2920,3320)\pos(969.376,389.396)}Sūn Quán \NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.90,0:34:46.78,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Quan refused.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.48,0:34:51.80,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,After this, Cao Cao had intentions to march south.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.00,0:34:52.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(977.6,473.6)}Huáng Gài \NStyled: Gōngfù
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.12,0:34:55.88,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,In the spring of thirteenth year of the Jian'an era, 208 CE.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.88,0:35:00.18,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Sun Quan followed the wish of his mother, Consort Dowager Wu,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.18,0:35:02.43,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,to seek vengeance for his father, Sun Jian.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.43,0:35:05.83,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,Raising troops, he invaded Liu Biao's officer, Huang Zu.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.83,0:35:11.20,Thinking,Narrator,0,0,0,,He stationed his troops at Chaisang and sought to take the lands of Jing-Xiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.24,0:35:27.36,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Sun Quan of Wu killed Huang Zu and took Xiakou.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.36,0:35:31.12,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Now that he is camped at Chaisang, he surely covets lands of Jing-Xiang.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.02,0:35:34.56,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yet, Liu Biao of Jing is bedridden with illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.56,0:35:37.46,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,His son, Liu Qi, ignorant and incompetent,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.46,0:35:40.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,has no ability to uphold a great enterprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.83,0:35:44.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,After we defeated Liu Bei at Runan,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.66,0:35:46.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,he has taken refuge under Liu Biao.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:46.54,0:35:49.00,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Now he conspires to seize Jing Province for himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.63,0:35:53.66,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Why would he not take it over from within given the chance?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.96,0:35:53.08,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3600,4120)\pos(827.82,401.818)}Cáo Cāo\NStyled: Mèngdé
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.66,0:35:56.34,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,He is now stationed at a puny place like Xinye,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.56,0:35:58.44,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(480.354,414.574)}Xú Shù \NStyled: Yuánzhí
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.34,0:35:59.49,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,recruiting troops and accumulating provisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.44,0:36:01.60,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(424.376,503.863)}Xún Yù\NStyled: Wénruò
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.09,0:36:03.41,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,His wild ambitions of hegemony are in plain sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.14,0:36:08.10,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Before he can spread his wings,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.10,0:36:09.90,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I will attack him once more!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.90,0:36:11.88,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,There cannot be any delay!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.49,0:36:21.82,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,I have recently heard of a strategist under Liu Bei.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.82,0:36:23.62,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,One by the name of Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.46,0:36:28.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,What kind of man is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.67,0:36:36.32,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,This Zhuge Liang is of the family Zhuge, his forename of Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.32,0:36:39.96,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,He is twenty-six or twenty-seven in age.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.84,0:36:48.00,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4800,5160)\pos(323.2,499.2)}Xiàhóu Dūn \NStyled: Yuánràng
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.39,0:36:48.02,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,Now a whelp serves as his strategist?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.02,0:36:51.00,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,Liu Bei has no men left!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.17,0:36:57.05,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.48,0:36:58.48,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.14,0:37:03.96,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Is Zhuge Liang an acquaintance of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.94,0:37:07.58,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,He is.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.58,0:37:11.82,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is styled Kongming, but people call him Sir Sleeping Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.58,0:37:18.92,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,So how does his talent compare to yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.34,0:37:25.04,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,How can I dare compare myself to Zhuge Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.82,0:37:29.06,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,If I am as dim as the light of a firefly,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.06,0:37:31.08,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has the radiance of a full moon.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.04,0:37:37.07,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Chancellor.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.17,0:37:44.58,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang has ability to administer the Heaven and Earth and can turn the tide of the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:44.58,0:37:48.92,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,A tactical mind gods cannot fathom and a titanic will.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.92,0:37:52.98,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,He is the greatest genius of our age.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.42,0:38:00.36,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Liu Bei possesses the ambitions of a {\i1}kunpeng.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.42,0:38:00.36,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Note: A kūnpéng refers to a legendary roc, a majestic bird (peng) transforming from a fish (kun).
Dialogue: 0,0:38:00.36,0:38:04.63,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,Now, Zhūgě Liàng is to him like giving water to a fish, or wings to a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.63,0:38:06.01,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I do fear...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.18,0:38:10.74,Default,Xu Shu,0,0,0,,I do fear none under Heaven can rival him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.74,0:38:12.70,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,Xu Yuanzhi, do not spout nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.18,0:38:16.06,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,Zhuge Liang is as insignificant as a blade of grass!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.06,0:38:17.32,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,What is there to fear?!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.22,0:38:20.82,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Calm down, General Xiahou.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.82,0:38:23.39,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Yuanzhi's words has his reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.39,0:38:26.50,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is a mighty hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.50,0:38:31.60,Default,Xun You,0,0,0,,Now with Zhuge Liang under him as a strategist, we cannot underestimate him.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.40,0:38:34.58,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,Liu Bei is but a rat!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.58,0:38:35.96,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,I will take him alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.24,0:38:39.04,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Very well! Remember, the army is not a place for jests.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.99,0:38:43.30,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,I'll gladly leave a military pledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.30,0:38:46.32,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,I will capture Liu Bei and Zhuge Liang alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.32,0:38:51.26,Default,Xiahou Dun,0,0,0,,If I fail, I will gladly give my head to the Chancellor!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:51.82,0:38:52.58,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Very well!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.43,0:38:55.91,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Xiahou Dun shall serve as Commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:55.91,0:38:58.98,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,with Yu Jin, Li Dian, and Han Hao as deputy officers.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.98,0:39:03.54,Default,Cao Cao,0,0,0,,Gather 100,000 troops and aim straight for Xinye.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.54,0:39:04.54,Default,Yu Jin,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.54,0:39:04.86,Default,Li Dian,0,0,0,,Understood!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.86,0:39:05.53,Default,Han Hao,0,0,0,,Understood!
Comment: 0,0:15:54.20,0:15:57.24,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,This is a Han dynasty sundial used to calculate time and dates.

